    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Behind them, the space where the Crystalline Convergence had been flickered once more before fading entirely."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The trial was complete, the choice made."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What remained was to see what this new unity could accomplish when tested against the challenges ahead."
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon mail sang with quiet satisfaction as they walked, its consciousness no longer divided but whole."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tran's memories and Zaron's purpose had found their convergence point, creating a being prepared for whatever lay ahead."
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The final fragment was claimed."
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The true test was about to begin."
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "end of chapter 096-violet convergence"
    }
